    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A little slice of heaven on earth is available for you now at 26 The Saltings in Annagassan, in County Louth. Annagassan is a little, very quiet, very modest place. It`s situated between Dunleer and Castlebellingham along the northeast coast, and it is a quiet, unassuming little village comprising, amongst the best local eateries and drinkeries that you`ll find.\n\nThe property is situated within a modern, well-maintained development called The Saltings, which comprises houses and apartments. The one that I`m putting on the market now is a ground-floor, two-bedroom apartment with its own private terrace. It measures over 80 m², and the accommodation is as follows:\n\n- two double bedrooms, one to the front and one to the back\n- one of them is en-suite\n- main bathroom\n- an open-plan kitchen/diner/living area, which is incredibly spacious and bright and affords plenty of space for preparing, cooking, and eating your food, as well as having space for your living area and television area\n\n\nDoors lead out to this gorgeous private terrace, which has uninterrupted views of the sea, the shore, and beyond the Mourne Mountains. This property is going to appeal to many people, be it for a full-time home or for a part-time home, and it is now ready to view in immaculate condition."
      },
